Those are this session itself and the driver's shell, not leftover work. Nothing of mine is still running, and all deliverables are in place.

**Item 06 is done, with the kill criterion met: branching is closed.**

What was built:
- `learning/obstruction_branch.py`: the separator-branch search with the branches' widths proved by the C program (or a clique, a trivial node, or family M's ladder on the branch), a tabu local search over `S` up to size 6, depth 2, and a lazy evaluation with upper bounds so a branch is sent to the C program only when it could raise the value. That also yields a per-instance potential, a ceiling on what the rule can give at the separators tried.
- `paper1/obstruction_check.py check-branch`: independent checker with its own BFS, relabelling and graph6, re-running the C program on every leaf and recursing through nested nodes. It rejects a damaged link, a damaged branch, an inflated claim and a trivial node claiming more than zero.
- 16 tests, all passing; the gate passed (1,864 + 123 tests, Lean unchanged, 77-page paper).

What the search found:
- On the 11 residual instances, B changes nothing. No linked triple exists on 8 of them. On the other 3 the value is 2 or 3 against optima of 25 to 80. Vertex connectivity is 1 to 3 on seven of them, so small separators exist, but every one found peels off one to three fringe customers from a core that stays connected.
- Over all 338 gap instances a linked triple exists on 156, B closes none, exceeds the record on none, and beats the reference on exactly one (`p2050n1_0`, value 6 against optimum 7, which family M had already closed). The potential's mean gap equals the value's, so the leaves are essentially exact and the shortfall is the third-largest branch itself.
- The seeded form of ml_nature §38 never exceeded its seed on these 338; exact branch widths moved one value by one.
- 156 of 156 certificates verified by the checker; harness validity on all 6,376 instances shows zero values above the optimum.
- Compute was about one core-hour of the item's four.

Two deviations are recorded in the report: the recorded item-04/05 minor certificates cannot restrict to an induced subgraph, so the minor leaf runs the ladder on the branch instead (it fired on 8 instances and improved none), and the link condition is reimplemented on bit masks, pinned equal to the harness's by a test.

